    "_comment_seedance": [
      "Seedance is billed per output token, not per second. These figures are",
      "BytePlus's own formula evaluated for what the task actually asks for:",
      "tokens = width x height x fps / 1024 per second of output, so at 720p",
      "and 24fps that is 21,600 tokens a second, and dollars-per-second is the",
      "published rate per million times 0.0216. The formula reproduces the",
      "worked examples on the pricing page exactly, which is why these are",
      "listed rather than marked unknown. List prices, not the promotion that",
      "ends 7 September 2026. Anything with a reference video costs more and",
      "has a token floor -- hence approx.",
      "https://docs.byteplus.com/en/docs/ModelArk/1544106"
